  "description": {
    "en-US": "Doctor of Grace (354–430). Bishop of Hippo, defender of the Catholic faith against the Manichees, Donatists, and Pelagians, and the pillar of all subsequent Western theology.",
    "pt-BR": "Doutor da Graça (354–430). Bispo de Hipona, defensor da fé católica contra os maniqueus, os donatistas e os pelagianos, e pilar de toda a teologia ocidental posterior.",
    "la": "Doctor Gratiae (354–430). Episcopus Hipponensis, fidei catholicae contra Manichaeos, Donatistas et Pelagianos defensor, totiusque posterioris theologiae occidentalis columen."
  },
